ss=\"bb_paragraph\" > Three different difficulty settings to cater to every player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A creative mode that allows you to design your own levels with over 100+ objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Over 30 achievements to complete.</p></li></ul>",
